{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"791","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Bear and Big Brother"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Bear Limak wants to become the largest of bears, or at least to become larger than his brother Bob."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Right now, Limak and Bob weigh "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" respectively. It's guaranteed that Limak's weight is smaller than or equal to his brother's weight."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Limak eats a lot and his weight is tripled after every year, while Bob's weight is doubled after every year."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After how many full years will Limak become strictly larger (strictly heavier) than Bob?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of the input contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ a ≤ b ≤ 10"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the weight of Limak and the weight of Bob respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer, denoting the integer number of years after which Limak will become strictly larger than Bob."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 9\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample, Limak weighs "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" and Bob weighs "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"7"},{"kind":"text","text":" initially. After one year their weights are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4·3 = 12"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"7·2 = 14"},{"kind":"text","text":" respectively (one weight is tripled while the other one is doubled). Limak isn't larger than Bob yet. After the second year weights are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"36"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"28"},{"kind":"text","text":", so the first weight is greater than the second one. Limak became larger than Bob after two years so you should print "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample, Limak's and Bob's weights in next years are: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"12"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"18"},{"kind":"text","text":", then "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"36"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"36"},{"kind":"text","text":", and finally "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"108"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"72"},{"kind":"text","text":" (after three years). The answer is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":". Remember that Limak wants to be larger than Bob and he won't be satisfied with equal weights."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third sample, Limak becomes larger than Bob after the first year. Their weights will be "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" then."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"791A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/791/problem/A"}